{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：19:00 2026-09-28 HKT</p>\n\n<p>現年84歲、素有「喜劇泰斗」之稱的許冠文（Michael），出道超過半世紀至今依然活躍於影壇。學識淵博的他，不時對生活與人生發表獨到見解。近日，他獲邀登上香港電台全新節目《移植新突破》，罕有地豁達大談自己的生死觀。他明確指出自己絕無「保留全屍」的觀念，認為人去世後，應將有用的器官全數捐出遺愛人間，更直言死後仍執著於全屍等同「霸住」，根本毫無必要。</p>\n<h2>許冠文批保留全屍觀念</h2>\n<p>在傳統觀念中，不少人因為執著於「保留全屍」而對器官捐贈望而卻步。對此，向來幽默且敢言的許冠文在節目中表達了極為直接且豁達的看法。他認為，人到了真正需要別人照顧的時候，才會深刻體會到自己並非萬能，因此更應該在有能力時伸手幫助他人。</p>\n<img alt=\"許冠文近日罕談身後事，指不認同「保留全屍」的觀念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0df2d8ab9beedc048b4206c3a881ef98/2026-09/01_6.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"許冠文在2023年奪得金像獎最佳男配角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97f57926fa1de10c8c4544b69df8949f/2023-04/VideoScreenshot--ViuTV-3439%E2%80%9905%E2%80%9D_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許氏兄弟各有所長！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fe01378ba66e4386317349bac78892e/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9917%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當年是許冠引薦加入TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cfba8c46a91f17c16ae807314832394/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9920%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"參與過不少節目之演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed976cc0dd6f9e364b7278a12ba446dc/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9922%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"參與過不少節目之演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/561a6311a8827dd13bd5092a9f73829b/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9924%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"與許冠傑演出喜劇綜藝節目《雙星報喜》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/258094d7504d7f3a9244c675284fe194/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9927%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"參與幕後工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/961d39085864ea930699e3eb55259de4/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9930%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"演出過不少電影！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a26f10bc663c26a40a1973cf7aeba4dc/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9937%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《合家歡》\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0b3ef29b4f945bc894ece3ee7fab87d/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9938%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"演出大受好評。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a3668fe1e0b718dab097f360c3766b3/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9940%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兄弟多年來都好齊心！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/401bdc46856dddce61bf5e7eb0672813/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9943%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兄弟多年來都好齊心！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d33ee1dc0359f316799de163a724f6d/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9944%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"合作得好開心！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a95477525e06e528de06f8f6f8f61daa/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9947%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兄弟多年來都好齊心！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdbdd395ede303448d91a3415d68d7c7/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9950%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"角色好深入民心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9701590c6bc34e496a86e7bae9f4714/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9951%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兄弟多年來都好齊心！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04fd64967fc6f3d05ba049d0337121fa/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9957%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"合作好有默契！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f09d3522952fef1e42e2a10b8fb9b664/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-5%E2%80%9959%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《摩登保鑣》係當時的票房保證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4a09337361c4161f7e6dd4105e9d474/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-6%E2%80%9908%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《摩登保鑣》連續五次成為年度票房冠軍，並三度刷新香港開埠票房最高紀錄，成為當時的票房保證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29b145df0551c85fcfddebe959e9ef01/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-6%E2%80%9909%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"票房保證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7220c87b3b0545f602c6b0caa70abc68/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-6%E2%80%9910%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<h2>許冠文：有咩需要全屍？</h2>\n<p>對於器官捐贈，他直言：「譬如捐贈你嘅器官，你可以嘅話就捐畀人哋，自己都冇用嗰時，你都自己要霸住，仲要全屍。有咩需要全屍呢？」在他眼中，不認同這種「保留全屍」的傳統睇法，認為自己既然已經用不著，卻還要霸佔著有用的器官，實屬多餘。</p>\n<h2>許冠文早交代身後事</h2>\n<p>除了支持器官捐贈，許冠文對於自己的身後事亦早已有一套超然的安排。他透露，自己早已和妻兒討論過身後事的立場與細節，並交代了心中一個特別的心願——希望死後能將骨灰撒入大海（如西貢海域），將養分還給海洋。</p>\n<h2>許冠文盼骨灰撒海當魚糧</h2>\n<p>他曾笑稱，自己一生吃了不少魚，死後撒海當魚糧也是一種回饋；而且後人想念他時，只需到海邊看看大海即可，既不需要花費巨資去爭奪骨灰位，也能減輕家人的負擔。雖然許冠文坦言，這個「骨灰撒海」的心願當時並未得到太太的贊成與同意，但這份豁達的安排，已充分展現出他獨特且充滿智慧的生死哲學。</p>\n<img alt=\"2022年許冠文獲頒終身成就獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea11b1efe9b52727cebeb38c8f87dfd8/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-6%E2%80%9941%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2022年許冠文獲頒終身成就獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66ebebe63bfb9ea3c8833a46d07cdb19/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-7%E2%80%9902%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許冠文話永不言休！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b946b587f525c3e3abc037b68222addb/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-7%E2%80%9940%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"太太一直喺背後好支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30918e973299eb8fa1991f3502c68d76/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-40-The40thHongKongFilmAwardsLifetimeAchievementAwardee-MrMichaelHui-7%E2%80%9951%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許氏三兄弟各有所長！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa41d18778dcc54769d7c4c896104c79/2023-03/152_BLE_16.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f989f48b19c0a5853592827fdc01f4f/2023-03/2016-11-15-PHOTO-00000011.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca8ddc307778877d40a7470260d65cfc/2023-03/sdm06p03150804.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩兄弟一直合作無間。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fea0e0f78c9d18bc36df8dcf9fb84a93/2023-03/sdm06p04150804.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d075b0b4f6ef534c042e4d299982979/2023-03/%E5%A4%A7%E8%BB%8D%E9%96%A5_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cfeba3552addec916a3db920d8c0bbf/2023-03/%E5%A4%A7%E8%BB%8D%E9%96%A5_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"（上排左起）許冠文、許冠英、許冠武和許冠傑組成「許氏兄弟」，對香港電影的貢獻可謂功不可沒！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6dc3d5a0062e65b248f7eee888addb10/2022-12/unknown_188786084_485902049294308_8855187108574131151_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許冠文在70年代已經活躍娛樂圈！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b806290ea11deff1c6c7f076dc919d79/2022-12/246211231_400638981618185_1424277665459186595_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"拍過好多經典電影！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b8f27c5b045e8e8dd6b865652ac2b9f/2022-12/ffTsa8zytaP3yxa0HXrt2g0PNxRASm4UwoK4pMKCuKQ.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"首部作品《鬼馬雙星》在當年票房創下佳績。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/988c94570de39f3b16f2f281c4e0925b/2022-12/lk9KOIWQ9tOFI3jqLxEAeOe5p3g2iQaIvoWNO76FjTs.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《新半斤八兩》\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32ac9ff5ac7414d5d04d646af8ec419f/2022-12/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-2015BoxSet2-0%E2%80%9958%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《新半斤八兩》\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4318734944a23b7259a31fc70e0201fd/2022-12/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-2015BoxSet2-0%E2%80%9959%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"故事講許冠文係雜誌社老闆，為咗唔執笠而要諗方法增加銷量！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8073281818438fb549110bb3831a811/2022-12/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-2015BoxSet2-1%E2%80%9900%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在許冠文的演藝生涯中，兩位弟弟許冠傑和許冠英一直陪伴著他。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1bcdfcbc01a13e16c12d5e00e0b8972e/2022-07/1e534584f53f499f9476ddf34fef63c4.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許冠文曾經講過許冠英一直都好畏懼他：「因為我又係十全十美主義者，個人喺片場好忟，又以為細佬係自己兄弟，唔使氹，所以不自覺對佢好惡，搞到佢好驚我，後來有幾個朋友都提醒我，要對兄弟好啲，尤其係許冠英，我之後好想補救，但佢對我嘅恐懼已經形成咗，我覺得好遺憾，我心裏其實好錫佢。」  \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35cdfe014e9939e55ed78cfc6d376b13/2022-12/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-HD--39%E2%80%9914%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《合家歡》\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d66a762835baee612a17fa5f7321f3a/2022-12/VideoScreenshot--YouTube-2015BoxSet2-1%E2%80%9912%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T11:19:21.196761+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":713,"images":41,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}